BlockBlast Privacy Policy

Last Updated: August 3, 2026

1. Welcome

Thank you for playing BlockBlast, developed by Weezard Games. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about how information is handled while you enjoy the game.

2. Information Used

BlockBlast primarily stores gameplay information such as scores, completed levels, achievements, settings, and preferences on your device to provide a seamless experience.

3. Advertising

To support continued development, BlockBlast may display advertisements from trusted partners such as Google AdMob. These providers may process limited technical information, including advertising identifiers, under their own privacy policies.

4. Diagnostics and Improvements

Anonymous crash reports, device information, and gameplay statistics may be used to identify technical issues, improve performance, refine game balance, and enhance future updates. These reports are not intended to identify individual players.

5. Data Protection

We apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect information associated with BlockBlast. While no digital service can guarantee absolute security, we continuously review and improve our security practices.

6. Children's Privacy

BlockBlast is designed for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has submitted personal information, please contact us so we can investigate and respond appropriately.

7. Future Features

Future versions of BlockBlast may introduce optional cloud saves, online leaderboards, seasonal events, or account synchronization. If additional information is required for these features, this Privacy Policy will be updated before they become available.

8. Your Choices

You may stop using BlockBlast at any time by uninstalling the application. Where supported, you may also adjust advertising preferences through your device or Google account settings.

9. Policy Updates

We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our services, legal requirements, or new features. The latest version will always be available with an updated revision date.

10. Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or BlockBlast, please contact Weezard Games using the support information provided in the official Google Play listing.

Our Commitment

At Weezard Games, we believe great games should respect player privacy. We remain committed to providing a secure, transparent, and enjoyable BlockBlast experience for every player.
